From _baseMenu.js, there is a blur() method that sets focusState = "none" and if shouldFocus then dom.menu.blur() (but note typo: blur() calls dom.menu.blur()? Actually they wrote `this.dom.menu.blur();` but there's a typo: they wrote `this.dom.menu.blur();`? Wait I see in the provided source:

